The eezo sprites

  assets/bertieprogression/textures/block/eezo_ore.png
  assets/bertieprogression/textures/item/raw_eezo.png
  assets/bertieprogression/textures/item/eezo_ingot.png

are original and are drawn by texture-work/make_eezo.py. They deliberately use
the same five greys as vanilla bedrock, read off that texture with a histogram,
because the ore is meant to be mistaken for bedrock. No Mojang pixels are
copied: the arrangement, the silhouettes and the shading are all drawn here, and
a palette of RGB values carries no licence of its own.

Every other asset here is original.
